obtura (0.9.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Obtura for Windows 10 and 11 (a separate installer and zip; the Ubuntu
    package is unchanged apart from the fixes below).
  * Editor: a mark below a blur, pixelate, box or magnifier now shows its new
    shape at once when it is resized, turned or bent.

